  "rationale": "The corrected stationary bootstrap still received only filled-trade P&L in the baseline economic replay. Abstained, cancelled, and rejected market opportunities disappeared, overstating activity-adjusted evidence and breaking the interpretation of consecutive condition blocks. The correction constructs one chronological value for every evaluated condition and assigns zero P&L when no fill occurred. Separate minimum-fill, profitable-condition, fill-rate, and execution-state controls remain intact. Because eligible and candidate sequences can contain gaps, output no longer labels a block of observed conditions as an exact elapsed duration.",
